#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: plogins-followup.php
msgid "Plogins Followup - Follow-Up Emails for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: plogins-followup.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-followup/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: plogins-followup.php
msgid ""
"Send automated post-purchase emails to WooCommerce customers: thank-you and "
"review requests, a set number of days after an order."
msgstr ""
"Sende automatisierte E-Mails nach dem Kauf an WooCommerce-Kunden: "
"Dankeschön- und Bewertungsanfragen, eine festgelegte Anzahl von Tagen nach "
"einer Bestellung."

#. Author of the plugin
#: plogins-followup.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: plogins-followup.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr ""

#: plogins-followup.php:79
msgid ""
"Followup - Order Follow-Up Emails for WooCommerce requires WooCommerce to be "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Follow-up, Bestell-Folge-E-Mails für WooCommerce erfordern, dass WooCommerce "
"aktiv ist."

